Description: lock screen of the FlickOS desktop
 Locks the screen with a password box that can show the password, the time,
 the date and the user's name and picture, in the colors of the desktop style
 in use.
 .
 The screen is covered at once, before the lock screen itself has loaded,
 and stays covered if the lock screen stops working: swaylock then takes
 over. FlickOS's Settings run it for Super+L, the menus and the idle lock.

